From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Banana Pi -BPI <lionwang@sinovoip.com.cn>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] BPI-M5-U-Boot-eMMC-25MHz-legacy

部分 M5 批次搭配 Hynix eMMC 時，在 U-Boot 高速模式讀取大型檔案可能
失敗。U-Boot 只負責可靠載入開機檔案，因此以 8-bit legacy 模式限制在
25 MHz；Linux 仍可依自己的 DTB 使用已驗證的 100 MHz HS200 設定。

Meson MMC 驅動同時讀取標準 max-frequency 與板級
u-boot,legacy-mmc 屬性，讓降速範圍限於需要的板卡。

Signed-off-by: Banana Pi -BPI <lionwang@sinovoip.com.cn>
---
 .../dts/meson-sm1-bananapi-m5-u-boot.dtsi    | 11 +++++++++++
 drivers/mmc/meson_gx_mmc.c                   | 12 ++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 23 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/meson-sm1-bananapi-m5-u-boot.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/meson-sm1-bananapi-m5-u-boot.dtsi
index a86fdb5668d3..1fdb1fac05a0 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/meson-sm1-bananapi-m5-u-boot.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/meson-sm1-bananapi-m5-u-boot.dtsi
@@ -11,3 +11,14 @@ &ethmac {
 	snps,reset-delays-us = <0 10000 1000000>;
 	snps,reset-active-low;
 };
+
+&sd_emmc_c {
+	/delete-property/ cap-mmc-highspeed;
+	/delete-property/ mmc-ddr-1_8v;
+	/delete-property/ mmc-hs200-1_8v;
+	bus-width = <8>;
+	no-mmc-hs400;
+	/* U-Boot 只需穩定載入檔案，Linux 另有較快的 DTB 設定。 */
+	u-boot,legacy-mmc;
+	max-frequency = <25000000>;
+};
diff --git a/drivers/mmc/meson_gx_mmc.c b/drivers/mmc/meson_gx_mmc.c
index 0825c0a2a838..e7d12e52dd2e 100644
--- a/drivers/mmc/meson_gx_mmc.c
+++ b/drivers/mmc/meson_gx_mmc.c
@@ -263,6 +263,7 @@ static int meson_mmc_probe(struct udevice *dev)
 	struct mmc_config *cfg = &pdata->cfg;
 	struct clk_bulk clocks;
 	uint32_t val;
+	u32 f_max;
 	int ret;
 
 	/* Enable the clocks feeding the MMC controller */
@@ -280,6 +281,17 @@ static int meson_mmc_probe(struct udevice *dev)
 			MMC_MODE_HS_52MHz | MMC_MODE_HS;
 	cfg->f_min = DIV_ROUND_UP(SD_EMMC_CLKSRC_24M, CLK_MAX_DIV);
 	cfg->f_max = 100000000; /* 100 MHz */
+	if (!dev_read_u32(dev, "max-frequency", &f_max))
+		cfg->f_max = f_max;
+
+	/* 指定 legacy 模式的板卡不得進入高速、DDR、HS200 或 HS400。 */
+	if (dev_read_bool(dev, "u-boot,legacy-mmc")) {
+		cfg->host_caps &= ~(MMC_MODE_HS_52MHz | MMC_MODE_HS |
+				    MMC_MODE_DDR_52MHz | MMC_MODE_HS200 |
+				    MMC_MODE_HS400 |
+				    MMC_MODE_HS400_ES);
+	}
+
 	cfg->b_max = 511; /* max 512 - 1 blocks */
 	cfg->name = dev->name;
 
-- 
